description:
This dataset pre-computes all English-centric directions from bible-nlp/biblenlp-corpus, and as a result loading is significantly faster.
Loading example:
>>> from datasets import load_dataset
>>> dataset = load_dataset("davidstap/biblenlp-corpus-mmteb", "eng-arb", trust_remote_code=True)
>>> dataset
DatasetDict({
    train: Dataset({
        features: ['eng', 'arb'],
        num_rows: 28723
    })
    validation: Dataset({
        features: ['eng', 'arb'],
        num_rows: 1578
    })… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/mteb/biblenlp-corpus.
